## Key Concepts
- useSyncExternalStore for external state subscriptions
- Tenant-isolated caching with Map-based storage
- Memoized selectors to prevent unnecessary re-renders
- React.memo and useTransition for smooth UI updates
- SSR-safe defaults and hydration patterns
- Proper cleanup on tenant switching

## Code Example
